WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:08.299
Tohji and Kensuke...

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.720
Everybody left to find somewhere else
to live after losing their homes here.

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:18.059
There's nobody... There's nobody
here that I can call a friend now.

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:19.561
Nobody.

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:24.399
I can't even go see Ayanami.
I don't have the courage.

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:27.110
I don't know how I should treat her.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:33.616
Asuka, Ms. Misato, Mom... What should I...

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:35.618
What should I do?

00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:57.515
Aren't songs great?

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:00.310
Songs enrich the heart.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:03.104
They're the crowning achievement
of Lilin culture.

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:05.273
Don't you think so...

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:07.817
Shinji Ikari?

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:11.029
-You know my name?
-Everybody knows you.

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:15.533
No offense, but I think you should
be more aware of your importance.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:16.993
I should?

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.037
Um, who are you?

00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:21.498
I'm Kaworu. Kaworu Nagisa.

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:25.376
Like you, I'm a child whose path has
been set out. I'm the Fifth Children.

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:29.339
You're the Fifth Children, uh... Nagisa?

00:01:29.839 --> 00:01:31.633
Call me Kaworu, Ikari.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.761
Um, call me Shinji, then.

